# pop'n music 14 FEVER!: the nine event-phase codes, typed in test mode > EVENT OPTIONS > PHASE
# PASSWORD (games/popn14/unlocks.toml). From a save at phase 0, it leaves one at MAX phase, with a
# snap of EVENT OPTIONS after each code:
#   hiraku-popn14 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn14-phases.his
# As pop'n 13: the menus open slowly and start on EXIT, and EVENT OPTIONS shows no password line:
# blue right then red opens PHASE PASSWORD. The wheel: blue 6/4 turn it (0-9, A-Z, from 0 for each
# code), red 5 enters. After the tenth character the game writes the save and goes back.
game popn14
